    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957330/extras/0fe61181ab8255fbd9df4abeb99223fb.avif?t=1734045135\" width=600 height=145 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957330/extras/cedf5237b5af8117c4fc6a44cc7bdefa.avif?t=1734045135\" width=500 height=145 /></span><br><br>You travel to a cabin to try and find your sister who has been missing for a few days. Once arriving in the woods you get trapped and are forced to stay at the cabin while you look for her. The wildlife around the cabin seems a little bit too supernatural for your liking. Spend the days looking for your sister and collecting resources. Spend the night struggling to hide and survive against the creatures of the night.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957330/extras/d27f92de3f3160562b066cf62fc05ac0.poster.avif?t=1734045135\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957330/extras/d27f92de3f3160562b066cf62fc05ac0.webm?t=1734045135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957330/extras/d27f92de3f3160562b066cf62fc05ac0.mp4?t=1734045135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957330/extras/07c889609d51026b375a9416e8aa5c0c.avif?t=1734045135\" width=500 height=145 /></span><br><br>\u2022 Look for your sister<br>\u2022 Explore the forest<br>\u2022 Collect Resources for the night<br>\u2022 Keep an eye out for creatures<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"ht